  "description": "Yerin, who works as a researcher in the new drug development department of a pharmaceutical company, is developing a hormonal medicine. One day, by mistake, she ends up giving her infamous boss Seonghoon a new medicine that hadn't finished clinical trials yet, instead of a headache medicine. Seonghoon, who initially sent Yerin away to the infirmary, calls her back to the office and says something unexpected... \n\n“My heart races when I think of you, Yerin. Why?\"\n\nA chemistry research diary between these two, while using an elixir of love!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63102758), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%83%81%EC%82%AC%EC%97%90%EA%B2%8C-%EC%A0%80%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%B8-%EB%82%98%EC%81%9C-%EC%A7%93/3845)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163334)",
